          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every operation carries its exact-review decision provenance and protected keeper identity into the signed manifest. RAW/sidecar and Live Photo families must move together. Each file is re-hashed immediately before it moves.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jede Operation überträgt den Prüfnachweis und die Identität des geschützten Originals in das signierte Manifest. RAW/Sidecar- und Live Photo-Familien müssen zusammen verschoben werden. Jede Datei wird unmittelbar vor dem Verschieben erneut gehasht."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chaque opération enregistre la provenance de décision et l'identité de l'original protégé dans le manifeste signé. Les familles RAW/associés et Live Photos doivent être déplacées ensemble. Chaque fichier est revérifié par hachage avant le déplacement."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Her işlem, kesin inceleme karar kaynağını ve korunan asıl kopya kimliğini imzalı bildirime işler. RAW/yan dosya ve Live Photo aileleri birlikte taşınmalıdır. Her dosya taşınmadan hemen önce tekrar doğrulanır."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every ready file matches the signed manifest and has an unoccupied original destination.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jedes fertige Dokument entspricht dem unterzeichneten Manifest und hat einen unbelegten ursprünglichen Bestimmungsort."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chaque fichier prêt correspond au manifeste signé et a une destination originale non occupée."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hazır durumdaki her dosya imzalı manifestle eşleşir ve boş bir özgün hedefe sahiptir."
          }
        }
      }
    },
