    "Only byte-identical SHA-256 sets support batch planning. Similar-photo results remain review-only, and every cleanup operation still passes keeper, family, collision, volume, manifest, and restore checks.": {
      "comment": "A description of the safety boundary between suggestions and cleanup.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nur byte-identische SHA-256-Sets unterstützen die Batch-Planung. Ergebnisse mit ähnlichen Fotos bleiben reine Prüfgruppen, und jede Bereinigungsoperation besteht weiterhin alle Prüfungen für Originale, Familien, Kollisionen, Volumen, Manifest und Wiederherstellung."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Seuls les ensembles SHA-256 identiques en octets prennent en charge la planification par lots. Les résultats de photos similaires restent réservés à l'examen, et chaque opération de nettoyage passe toujours les contrôles d'original, de famille, de collision, de volume, de manifeste et de restauration."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Yalnızca bayt düzeyinde özdeş SHA-256 kümeleri toplu planlamayı destekler. Benzer fotoğraf sonuçları yalnızca inceleme amaçlıdır; tüm temizleme işlemleri asıl kopya, aile, çakışma, birim, bildirim ve geri yükleme denetimlerinden geçer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only verified exact copies can enter cleanup.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nur verifizierte exakte Kopien können bereinigt werden."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Seules les copies exactes vérifiées peuvent être nettoyées."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Yalnızca doğrulanmış tam kopyalar temizlemeye alınabilir."
          }
        }
      }
    },
