            "value": "Satın alma işlemi tamamlanana kadar ekran açık kalır."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These metrics are computed from the on-device decision ledger and are never uploaded.": {
      "comment": "A description of the review insights displayed in the Review Insights view.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diese Metriken werden aus dem Entscheidungsprotokoll auf dem Gerät berechnet und werden nie hochgeladen."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ces mesures sont calculées à partir du registre de décision du dispositif et ne sont jamais téléchargées."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bu metrikler cihazdaki karar veritabanından hesaplanır ve asla sunucuya yüklenmez."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This asset has not been explicitly reviewed yet.": {
      "comment": "A tooltip for a button that opens a new view.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
