        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bu dosya henüz incelenmedi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This byte-identical copy was reviewed but intentionally left out of the Safety Plan.": {
      "comment": "A description of a decision that was reviewed but is not part of the Safety Plan.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diese byte-identische Kopie wurde überprüft, wurde aber absichtlich aus dem Sicherheitsplan ausgeschlossen."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cette copie identique en octets a été examinée, mais a été intentionnellement omise du plan de sécurité."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bu birebir kopya incelendi fakat bilerek Güvenlik Planı dışında bırakıldı."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This copy is the protected keeper. Keptora blocks it from quarantine until another keeper is selected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diese Kopie ist das geschützte Original. Keptora verhindert die Quarantäne, bis ein anderes Original ausgewählt wird."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cette copie est l'original protégé. Keptora empêche sa mise en quarantaine tant qu'un autre original n'est pas sélectionné."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bu kopya korunan asıl kopyadır. Başka bir asıl kopya seçilene kadar karantinaya alınması engellenir."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This group needs at least two members for synchronized comparison.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diese Gruppe benötigt mindestens zwei Elemente für einen synchronisierten Vergleich."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce groupe a besoin d'au moins deux membres pour une comparaison synchronisée."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Senkronize karşılaştırma için bu grupta en az iki öğe gerekir."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This may use network data and device storage. You can cancel the scan at any time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dies kann Netzwerkdaten und Gerätespeicher verwenden. Der Scan kann jederzeit abgebrochen werden."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cette opération peut utiliser le réseau et le stockage de l’appareil. Vous pouvez annuler l’analyse à tout moment."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bu işlem ağ verisi ve cihaz depolaması kullanabilir. Taramayı istediğiniz zaman iptal edebilirsiniz."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This may use network data and disk space. You can cancel between Photos items.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dies kann Netzwerkdaten und Speicherplatz beanspruchen. Kann zwischen Fotos-Elementen abgebrochen werden."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cela peut utiliser des données réseau et de l'espace disque. Vous pouvez annuler entre les éléments Photos."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bu işlem ağ verisi ve disk alanı kullanabilir. Fotoğraf öğeleri arasında iptal edebilirsiniz."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This plan contains recommendations outside the free 100-review allowance. Pro keeps every future plan unlimited and reversible.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieser Plan enthält Empfehlungen außerhalb des kostenlosen Kontingents von 100 Prüfungen. Pro hält jeden zukünftigen Plan unbegrenzt und wiederherstellbar."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce plan contient des recommandations au-delà de la limite gratuite de 100 examens. Pro permet des plans illimités et réversibles pour toujours."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bu plan, 100 ücretsiz inceleme hakkınızın üzerindeki önerileri içerir. Pro, gelecekteki tüm planları sınırsız ve geri alınabilir kılar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This planned copy matches the exact-set SHA-256 digest and is not the protected keeper. Keptora will still re-hash it immediately before quarantine.": {
      "comment": "A description of a decision evidence state that a file is part of the exact set and is not a protected keeper.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diese geplante Kopie entspricht dem SHA-256-Hash und ist nicht das geschützte Original. Keptora berechnet den Hash unmittelbar vor der Quarantäne erneut."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cette copie planifiée correspond au condensat SHA-256 et n'est pas l'original protégé. Keptora vérifiera à nouveau son empreinte avant la mise en quarantaine."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bu kopya SHA-256 özetiyle eşleşiyor ve asıl kopya değildir. Karantinaya alınmadan hemen önce tekrar doğrulanır."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This screen cannot be closed until the operation finishes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
